-  - **No longer on this list:** the `source-documents` storage bucket (captured 4 Aug 2026 in `supabase/migrations/20260804_ghg_source_documents_bucket_hardening.sql` and `..._policies.sql` — run the hardening one first, it creates the bucket row the policies reference). `scope3_inventories` (captured 8 Sep 2026 in `supabase/migrations/20260908_scope3_inventories_definition.sql`; note that file deliberately emits the wrapped `(select auth.uid())` policy form, diverging from live).
